1. DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

1.1 "UniVex Studios" means UniVex Studios, the copyright owner and licensor of
    the Software.

1.2 "You" or "Licensee" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights
    under this Agreement.

1.3 "Source Code" means the human-readable source files, build scripts, shaders,
    and configuration files included in the Software.

1.4 "End-User Product" means a video game, interactive simulation, visualization,
    or application that You develop using the Software, where the product
    delivers substantial original content or functionality created by You and is
    not itself a general-purpose game engine, editor, SDK, or authoring tool.

1.5 "Runtime Components" means the compiled runtime libraries and executables of
    the Software (such as `uve_runtime` and its required runtime libraries and
    built-in shader assets) strictly necessary to execute an End-User Product.

